- Refactored the `renderData` function to significantly improve initial page load performance by building an HTML string buffer instead of appending to the DOM in a loop.
- Resolved a bug where the image upload dialog would not appear.
- Fixed a series of cascading AJAX issues:
    - Removed a duplicate, buggy `smartAjaxCall` function from `api.js`.
    - Standardized AJAX call parameters to use `className` instead of `class`.
    - Corrected a server-side logic error in `getData` to ensure all items are loaded when category is 0.
    - Fixed a JSON parsing error during file uploads by adding `ob_clean()` to the AJAX listener to prevent PHP warnings from corrupting the response.
- Added a `showError` toast notification function for better user feedback on errors.